WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Weyden Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 26]

01:34.360 --> 01:36.000
Shall we begin?

01:43.800 --> 01:45.830
Matters concerning the ancestral temple,

01:45.920 --> 01:48.160
hereby passing on
to the future generations.

01:48.720 --> 01:50.260
Abiding by the ancient rites,

01:50.280 --> 01:52.180
a pact is formed.

01:52.200 --> 01:53.579
From today onward,

01:53.599 --> 01:56.499
bride and groom shall be of one heart.

01:56.519 --> 01:59.039
May death do them part.

02:07.519 --> 02:10.320
Bride and groom,
proceed with the ceremony.

02:10.519 --> 02:13.600
First, bow to Heaven and Earth,
and the ancestral temple.

02:13.839 --> 02:16.880
This rite is the base of all rites.

02:17.640 --> 02:19.320
Bow.

02:29.360 --> 02:32.020
Second, bow to one's parents
and the grand hall

02:32.040 --> 02:34.419
as a sign of respect
towards the rites of the tribes.

02:34.439 --> 02:35.519
Hold on.

02:39.800 --> 02:40.880
Madam Liu,

02:41.880 --> 02:43.039
sit there.

02:46.399 --> 02:47.580
I can't do so.

02:47.600 --> 02:49.259
I'm not the female head
of the Fan family.

02:49.279 --> 02:51.050
I cannot sit there as per the rites.

02:51.070 --> 02:52.780
If the rites don't acknowledge you,

02:52.800 --> 02:53.880
I will.

03:01.360 --> 03:03.280
Come, have a seat.

03:14.679 --> 03:17.580
Second, bow to one's parents
and the grand hall

03:17.600 --> 03:20.419
as a sign of respect
towards the rites of the tribes.

03:20.439 --> 03:23.280
May their families be harmonious.

03:25.959 --> 03:27.639
Rise.

03:30.559 --> 03:33.000
Bride and groom, bow to each other.

03:40.360 --> 03:42.079
Bow.

04:01.679 --> 04:03.479
Rise.

04:09.999 --> 04:13.140
Now, the bride and groom
completed the ceremony.

04:13.160 --> 04:16.280
The pact is completed.

04:27.675 --> 04:29.720
[Fan's Residence]

04:33.119 --> 04:34.199
Take a look.

04:34.439 --> 04:36.199
There are so many people here.

04:36.239 --> 04:37.959
It's just like a temple procession.

04:41.920 --> 04:46.260
Under Heaven's mandate,
the emperor's decree is as follows:

04:46.280 --> 04:48.140
"The Fan and Lin family
have a marriage alliance.

04:48.160 --> 04:50.140
It is done under auspicious timing
under Heaven's will.

04:50.160 --> 04:52.179
A handwritten scroll
shall be rewarded to them

04:52.199 --> 04:54.900
as a blessing.

04:54.920 --> 04:57.480
That is all."

05:02.125 --> 05:05.970
[100 Years of Union]

05:33.600 --> 05:40.145
[Fan's Residence]

05:49.080 --> 05:51.220
Do you need me to send you
back to your residence?

05:51.960 --> 05:53.159
No need for that.

05:54.160 --> 05:55.320
Thanks.

05:55.999 --> 05:57.270
Why are you thanking me?

05:57.439 --> 06:00.120
You didn't tell her
about Lin Gong's incident.

06:00.520 --> 06:03.020
I promised you
that I wouldn't ruin her wedding.

06:03.040 --> 06:05.680
I had to keep my word.

06:07.160 --> 06:08.560
Anyway,

06:08.606 --> 06:09.765
thank you.

06:10.480 --> 06:12.120
It's difficult for Wan'er

06:12.360 --> 06:13.759
to get to where she is today.

06:13.920 --> 06:15.660
Wan'er is my younger sister after all.

06:18.960 --> 06:20.120
I'll make a move now.

06:20.759 --> 06:22.000
Take care.

06:35.360 --> 06:36.719
Did you

06:37.119 --> 06:38.759
forget something?

06:44.239 --> 06:45.219
You're alone.

06:45.239 --> 06:46.680
I should send you back.

06:48.400 --> 06:49.480
That'll do.

06:49.720 --> 06:51.320
I'll leave my life

06:51.639 --> 06:53.079
to you now.

07:13.800 --> 07:14.880
Wan'er.

07:18.079 --> 07:19.519
You, come out.

07:20.800 --> 07:22.179
Stop hiding under the bed.

07:22.199 --> 07:23.279
We heard you.

07:29.879 --> 07:30.959
Xian.

07:32.280 --> 07:33.759
Sizhe?

07:33.800 --> 07:34.959
Wan'er.

07:37.960 --> 07:39.120
Congratulations.

07:40.160 --> 07:41.399
All right.

07:43.520 --> 07:45.199
May you two have a child soon.

07:45.840 --> 07:47.739
All these stupid rites and customs.

07:47.759 --> 07:49.120
I'll beat him up later.

07:55.480 --> 07:57.000
Throughout the entire day,

07:58.559 --> 08:00.059
I was only thinking of one thing.

08:00.079 --> 08:01.380
What was it?

08:01.400 --> 08:02.900
I wanted to see you.

08:02.920 --> 08:04.719
I haven't seen you the entire day.

08:11.319 --> 08:12.920
Who's there?

08:15.400 --> 08:16.519
Dabao?

08:16.800 --> 08:17.739
Dabao,

08:17.759 --> 08:19.719
you should go back.

08:21.759 --> 08:25.040
Little Xian,
I'm different from that brat.

08:25.079 --> 08:28.220
I'll go back
after seeing you kiss Wan'er.

08:28.280 --> 08:29.539
Dabao, be a good boy.

08:29.559 --> 08:31.040
Return to your room.

08:34.760 --> 08:37.440
Someone might steal
your hawthorns from you.

08:39.240 --> 08:40.020
You're right.

08:40.040 --> 08:42.560
Father gave me those hawthorns.

08:42.599 --> 08:45.179
Little brat!

08:45.199 --> 08:46.760
Little brat!

08:57.199 --> 08:58.719
It's already nighttime.

08:59.640 --> 09:01.160
What's with the endless events?

09:02.760 --> 09:03.920
What was that?

09:08.719 --> 09:09.920
Nothing.

09:10.199 --> 09:11.380
Wan'er, I'm sorry.

09:11.400 --> 09:13.210
I have to go. I'll be right back.

09:13.230 --> 09:14.839
I'll explain myself when I'm back.

09:25.359 --> 09:27.179
Mr. Wuzhu, it's been so long.

09:27.199 --> 09:28.059
Where have you been?

09:28.079 --> 09:29.680
I fought with Ku He.

09:30.479 --> 09:32.040
I know. You did it for my sake.

09:32.439 --> 09:33.620
Besides fighting him,

09:33.640 --> 09:35.479
I also asked him about the past events.

09:36.439 --> 09:37.439
[Wuzhu]
I forgot many things.

09:37.439 --> 09:38.539
[Servant of Fan Xian's late mother]

09:38.559 --> 09:39.539
I wish to recall them.

09:39.559 --> 09:40.659
What did Ku He say?

09:40.679 --> 09:43.830
Regarding Young Lady's past,
he wasn't willing to talk about it.

09:46.880 --> 09:48.440
My mother came from the temple.

09:48.479 --> 09:49.559
The temple?

09:50.110 --> 09:51.939
Ku He and the rest
were heading northward back then.

09:51.959 --> 09:54.479
They saw my mother
leaving the temple themselves.

09:56.000 --> 09:57.459
Mr. Wuzhu, say,

09:57.479 --> 09:59.479
were you from the temple as well?

10:00.920 --> 10:02.079
The temple?

10:05.439 --> 10:06.800
I can't remember anything.

10:07.079 --> 10:08.880
It's fine. We can head northward.

10:08.890 --> 10:10.060
Let's look for the temple together.

10:10.079 --> 10:12.500
You might remember something
once we find the temple.

10:12.520 --> 10:13.380
That won't happen.

10:13.400 --> 10:14.059
But why?

10:14.079 --> 10:15.179
You're married.

10:15.199 --> 10:16.819
Even so, it won't affect me.

10:16.839 --> 10:19.280
I can take Wan'er together with us.

10:19.599 --> 10:20.679
Mr. Wuzhu,

10:20.800 --> 10:23.440
I was thinking about this
during the bowing ceremony.

10:23.559 --> 10:24.819
If you were around,

10:24.839 --> 10:26.020
Wan'er and I would've bowed to you.

10:26.040 --> 10:28.939
Why didn't you ask me where I went

10:28.959 --> 10:29.860
after fighting Ku He?

10:29.880 --> 10:30.780
Where did you go?

10:30.800 --> 10:32.160
I went to the south.

10:34.800 --> 10:36.119
Are the streets empty?

10:36.160 --> 10:37.200
Yes.

10:37.220 --> 10:38.950
So they didn't return
to the Imperial Inspectorate

10:38.960 --> 10:40.520
just because they wanted to eat?

10:54.760 --> 10:55.840
Mr. Chen.

11:01.679 --> 11:04.319
One of you leads the Third Division
while the other leads the Sixth Division.

11:04.320 --> 11:06.840
[Shadow, Division Supervisor of the Sixth Division]
Both of you are the institute's backbones.

11:06.850 --> 11:08.040
[Fei Jie, Division Supervisor
of the Third Division]

11:08.040 --> 11:09.720
But you two actually fought
on the streets this late at night?

11:09.720 --> 11:12.190
If news of this gets out,
the institute will be humiliated!

11:12.640 --> 11:13.299
It's not that bad.

11:13.319 --> 11:14.640
Who said so?

11:14.990 --> 11:17.220
Even if someone were to be humiliated,
it wouldn't be me.

11:17.240 --> 11:18.579
I wear a mask every day.

11:18.599 --> 11:20.839
No one in the Capital
or the Imperial Inspectorate

11:20.959 --> 11:22.640
knows my real name.

11:23.439 --> 11:25.000
So, are you hiding your identity

11:25.000 --> 11:27.760
just because you can
go all-out during fights?

11:28.240 --> 11:30.040
He started it first.

11:31.920 --> 11:33.039
No.

11:33.400 --> 11:35.719
Do you know what day it is today?

11:36.040 --> 11:37.220
It's my disciple's wedding.

11:37.240 --> 11:38.380
I know that.

11:38.400 --> 11:40.059
Look at him and his shifty eyes.

11:40.079 --> 11:41.800
I'm sure he's up to no good.

11:42.120 --> 11:44.239
I had to keep an eye on him.

11:45.679 --> 11:48.440
How could you tell
that I had shifty eyes?

11:48.959 --> 11:51.520
Your posture alone gives yourself away.

11:52.199 --> 11:53.439
You can remove your mask

11:53.439 --> 11:54.980
when you eat, you know?

11:55.000 --> 11:56.440
Just eat properly.

11:56.520 --> 11:58.300
It's not like I never
saw your face before.

11:58.320 --> 12:00.040
And there's no one else in the streets.

12:00.240 --> 12:02.320
Why are you still hiding your face?

12:02.359 --> 12:03.560
Finish your noodles!

12:11.870 --> 12:13.599
Did you go to Fan Xian's residence?

12:14.079 --> 12:14.939
He stopped me.

12:14.959 --> 12:16.040
Why?

12:16.599 --> 12:18.760
Today's Fan Xian's wedding.

12:18.920 --> 12:21.220
Mr. Wuzhu would surely
visit him personally.

12:21.240 --> 12:23.299
My lifelong wish

12:23.319 --> 12:25.999
is to learn the essence
of martial arts from him

12:26.040 --> 12:27.440
and spar with him.

12:27.920 --> 12:30.040
You're seeking your own death here.

12:31.150 --> 12:32.879
This is the way of the martial artist.

12:33.110 --> 12:34.999
I might die,
but I won't have any regrets.

12:36.520 --> 12:37.680
Fei Jie,

12:38.719 --> 12:40.560
when did you return to the Capital?

12:40.599 --> 12:43.220
I rushed here.

12:43.240 --> 12:44.640
I just arrived not long ago.

12:44.679 --> 12:46.280
I haven't even had dinner yet.

12:46.959 --> 12:49.079
I missed the noodles here
when I went to the south.

12:49.080 --> 12:51.030
The noodles in the Capital are the best.

12:52.000 --> 12:53.400
According to the rules,

12:54.760 --> 12:57.440
you should've visited me
in the institute immediately.

12:59.280 --> 13:00.539
Yes, Mr. Chen.

13:00.559 --> 13:01.900
But I told you already.

13:01.920 --> 13:03.860
Today's my disciple's wedding.

13:03.880 --> 13:05.459
I have to visit him no matter what,

13:05.479 --> 13:06.559
am I right?

13:07.240 --> 13:09.860
Of course, I won't bother him.

13:09.880 --> 13:11.440
Even if I'm not bothering him,

13:11.719 --> 13:14.560
I won't allow anyone else to bother him.

13:17.160 --> 13:19.620
Was that why you were keeping guard
over Fan Xian's residence?

13:19.640 --> 13:21.539
That's right. At least it was worth it.

13:21.559 --> 13:22.839
I managed to stop him.

13:23.719 --> 13:24.879
Fei Jie,

13:25.959 --> 13:27.780
you were pursuing the culprit.

13:27.800 --> 13:29.199
And, you came from the south.

13:30.319 --> 13:31.659
Be honest with me.

13:31.679 --> 13:33.879
Was Wuzhu the culprit?

13:34.760 --> 13:38.800
I didn't manage to identify the culprit.

13:39.199 --> 13:41.520
Of course, I don't believe

13:41.679 --> 13:44.040
that Mr. Wu would kill people casually.

13:44.568 --> 13:45.680
But,

13:47.079 --> 13:49.280
just look at
how the murders were conducted.

13:50.160 --> 13:51.939
Who else besides Mr. Wu

13:51.959 --> 13:54.640
could commit such acts?

13:56.160 --> 13:57.459
Coincidentally,

13:57.479 --> 13:59.959
Mr. Wu was in Jiangnan when the murder

14:00.040 --> 14:00.939
occurred.

14:00.959 --> 14:03.119
Why was Wuzhu in Jiangnan?

14:03.760 --> 14:05.239
I have no idea.

14:06.719 --> 14:09.239
Back then, Young Lady and I
went to Jiangnan before.

14:09.439 --> 14:11.160
I wanted to re-visit
the roads and places

14:11.160 --> 14:12.380
we used to take.

14:12.400 --> 14:14.060
I'm trying to find
the past that I've lost.

14:14.080 --> 14:15.440
Did you get any results?

14:16.599 --> 14:17.679
No.

14:18.199 --> 14:19.959
Many people died in Jiangnan.

14:24.800 --> 14:25.880
I...

14:27.280 --> 14:28.400
I've heard of it.

14:29.679 --> 14:30.920
It wasn't me.

14:32.120 --> 14:33.560
So it wasn't you?

14:34.870 --> 14:36.839
That means someone
is trying to frame you.

14:36.880 --> 14:38.699
If we follow this train of thought,

14:38.719 --> 14:39.799
firstly,

14:40.640 --> 14:42.920
we need to consider
who can benefit from framing you.

14:43.040 --> 14:44.179
Secondly,

14:44.199 --> 14:45.860
we need to know
your itinerary at the south.

14:45.880 --> 14:46.559
Thirdly...

14:46.559 --> 14:48.280
But it can only be me.

14:49.079 --> 14:50.020
But why?

14:50.040 --> 14:51.920
I examined
the victims' bodies in secret.

14:52.160 --> 14:53.520
The person who did it

14:53.640 --> 14:54.959
was a grandmaster.

14:56.080 --> 14:57.620
If so, that means one of
the Four Grandmasters

14:57.640 --> 14:59.179
is trying to frame you here.

14:59.199 --> 15:00.140
Was it Sigu Jian?

15:00.160 --> 15:01.959
The killer didn't use any qi flow.

15:13.000 --> 15:14.359
Skills of a grandmaster,

15:14.460 --> 15:16.960
yet the murders were committed
without the usage of qi flow.

15:17.520 --> 15:18.999
Who else but me

15:20.160 --> 15:21.879
could achieve that?

15:22.800 --> 15:24.160
But you said

15:25.439 --> 15:26.659
that it wasn't you.

15:26.679 --> 15:27.759
Yes.

15:29.000 --> 15:30.719
I remember that I didn't do it.

15:33.280 --> 15:34.599
That's more than enough.

15:34.719 --> 15:36.160
The loss of my memories,

15:38.270 --> 15:39.910
since it already happened once,

15:41.199 --> 15:42.999
it might happen again.

15:43.839 --> 15:45.479
I cannot trust myself.

15:46.839 --> 15:47.919
Fan Xian.

15:50.359 --> 15:51.439
Yes, Mr. Wuzhu.

15:52.359 --> 15:53.599
Logically speaking,

15:54.240 --> 15:55.659
I shouldn't see you again.

15:55.679 --> 15:56.980
That doesn't make sense.

15:57.000 --> 15:59.539
I left the past behind,
and it's hard to find them again.

15:59.559 --> 16:00.780
Right now,

16:00.800 --> 16:02.359
I only have one goal.

16:03.120 --> 16:04.599
That is to protect you.

16:05.400 --> 16:07.090
If I hurt you
when I lose control of myself,

16:07.110 --> 16:08.699
I'll stay away from you immediately.

16:08.719 --> 16:11.320
I will never appear before you again.

16:13.520 --> 16:15.160
Mr. Wuzhu, you can't just abandon me.

16:16.839 --> 16:18.160
Look closely.

16:18.199 --> 16:19.500
At what?

16:19.520 --> 16:20.760
I can't see.

16:21.439 --> 16:23.479
Is there blood on it?

16:26.040 --> 16:26.980
No.

16:27.000 --> 16:28.330
If my memories were distorted

16:28.350 --> 16:29.839
and I forgot about the past,

16:30.120 --> 16:31.900
reality would at least
have some traces of it.

16:31.920 --> 16:33.680
I took a close look.

16:33.800 --> 16:35.560
It's clean.

16:35.599 --> 16:36.660
There's no hint of blood at all.

16:36.680 --> 16:38.119
I refrained from letting it

16:38.240 --> 16:40.240
get into contact with water
all this while.

16:42.240 --> 16:43.920
That means it's not you.

16:44.920 --> 16:46.800
My memories are no longer trustworthy.

16:47.439 --> 16:49.059
Reality is no longer trustworthy.

16:49.079 --> 16:51.440
Even I'm no longer trustworthy.

16:52.719 --> 16:54.640
Now, I'm standing before you

16:58.240 --> 16:59.920
because I trust you.

17:01.760 --> 17:02.840
Mr. Wuzhu,

17:04.119 --> 17:05.960
you can trust me forever.

17:09.200 --> 17:10.280
All right.

17:32.680 --> 17:33.879
I have to go.

17:34.000 --> 17:35.159
Where are you going?

17:35.559 --> 17:37.020
Don't vanish on me again.

17:37.040 --> 17:38.700
I won't leave the Capital for now.

17:38.720 --> 17:40.040
It's a promise, then.

17:42.079 --> 17:43.359
You're married.

17:43.399 --> 17:44.720
From now on,

17:45.200 --> 17:46.639
you'll have your own family.

17:48.760 --> 17:49.819
Do you still need me?

17:49.839 --> 17:51.320
I need you forever.

18:01.480 --> 18:02.720
Forever doesn't exist.

18:03.919 --> 18:04.999
Yes.

18:05.879 --> 18:07.200
Forever doesn't exist.

18:07.919 --> 18:09.399
But you mustn't be absent

18:10.119 --> 18:11.520
from my life.

18:12.240 --> 18:13.439
After your wedding,

18:13.520 --> 18:15.780
take the box
that Young Lady had left behind for you

18:15.800 --> 18:17.520
and live in Mount Cang for some time.

18:17.800 --> 18:18.960
Mount Cang?

18:37.359 --> 18:38.919
Who was that?

18:39.919 --> 18:42.159
That's my elder, Mr. Wuzhu.

18:43.359 --> 18:45.090
Why didn't he come inside?

18:45.110 --> 18:46.839
He has an eccentric personality.

18:49.200 --> 18:50.679
Why did you unveil yourself?

18:52.240 --> 18:53.270
I was startled just now.

18:53.290 --> 18:55.270
I was worried
that you might be in trouble.

18:57.079 --> 18:58.280
I'm sorry.

18:59.280 --> 19:00.800
Although today's our wedding,

19:01.079 --> 19:02.480
it's been quite a mess.

19:03.399 --> 19:04.379
Let's do it again.

19:04.399 --> 19:05.960
This is good enough.

19:06.800 --> 19:08.359
I have to give you

19:08.639 --> 19:10.159
the perfect wedding today.

19:19.960 --> 19:21.119
Trust me.

19:24.919 --> 19:27.320
I've been living
in the palace since young.

19:27.760 --> 19:30.359
It was inconvenient
for my parents to visit me.

19:31.480 --> 19:33.240
Every night,

19:33.760 --> 19:34.599
I would be all alone

19:34.599 --> 19:37.079
in a gigantic room.

19:38.119 --> 19:40.079
From that moment onward,

19:41.159 --> 19:43.639
I love to stare at the starry sky.

19:44.040 --> 19:46.240
It's because
there is nothing else for me to see

19:46.720 --> 19:48.879
except for the starry sky.

20:06.040 --> 20:07.760
I felt like something was lacking

20:08.079 --> 20:09.720
during the bowing ceremony.

20:09.839 --> 20:11.070
It was imperfect.

20:11.639 --> 20:12.839
Why do you say so?

20:14.280 --> 20:16.460
Only my father and Madam Liu
were present at the hall.

20:16.480 --> 20:18.439
It lacked your testimony.

20:20.319 --> 20:22.280
My parents were unable to attend it.

20:22.319 --> 20:23.520
It's fine.

20:23.559 --> 20:25.240
But the starry sky is always here.

20:29.159 --> 20:30.480
I remembered every word

20:30.800 --> 20:32.040
you said.

20:33.960 --> 20:35.800
The starry sky that you've given to me,

20:36.720 --> 20:38.119
it's always around.

20:47.440 --> 20:49.200
It witnessed your loneliness.

20:50.240 --> 20:51.399
It's time for it

20:53.599 --> 20:55.240
to witness your happiness.

20:56.399 --> 20:57.760
From now on,

20:58.079 --> 20:59.839
you're no longer alone.

21:13.559 --> 21:14.839
A ring?

21:15.919 --> 21:17.139
What's the use of it?

21:17.159 --> 21:18.539
I made it myself.

21:18.559 --> 21:20.580
A newlywed couple uses this to prove

21:20.600 --> 21:22.780
that they'll share
the rest of their lives together.

21:28.800 --> 21:30.720
Where does this saying come from?

21:32.760 --> 21:34.480
From the world in my memory.

21:35.559 --> 21:36.720
Later,

21:37.159 --> 21:38.760
I'll tell you all about

21:38.800 --> 21:39.899
those memories,

21:39.919 --> 21:41.000
okay?

21:42.319 --> 21:44.079
Here. It's your turn
to put it on for me.

21:48.040 --> 21:49.800
That's right. The ring finger.

21:57.680 --> 22:00.200
The pact is completed.

22:00.800 --> 22:02.359
The starry sky is our witness.

22:02.839 --> 22:04.359
From now on,

22:04.879 --> 22:06.400
we no longer need to walk alone.

22:10.159 --> 22:11.839
I like this promise.

22:32.960 --> 22:35.930
Did Mr. Wuzhu watch over you
as you grew up?

22:35.950 --> 22:37.940
He watched over me
from Danzhou to the Capital.

22:37.960 --> 22:39.859
I'm sure you have
plenty of stories related to him.

22:39.879 --> 22:42.379
I'll tell you about his stories
in the future.

22:42.399 --> 22:43.940
This isn't the time for stories.

22:43.960 --> 22:45.480
What should we do, then?

22:46.520 --> 22:47.679
Good question.

23:19.300 --> 23:25.795
[Fan's Residence]

23:25.919 --> 23:27.539
Mr. Fan, you're awake?

23:27.559 --> 23:28.780
Come.

23:28.800 --> 23:29.559
Madam, come.

23:29.559 --> 23:32.599
Come here.

23:33.040 --> 23:33.720
What are you doing?

23:33.720 --> 23:35.180
Mr. Fan, have a seat.

23:35.200 --> 23:36.220
Madam, please have a seat.

23:36.240 --> 23:37.139
What's the matter?

23:37.159 --> 23:38.239
Have a seat.

23:40.800 --> 23:42.800
All of you, come here.

23:50.810 --> 23:52.310
Did something crop up
in the First Division?

23:52.319 --> 23:53.740
Why are all of them here?

23:53.760 --> 23:54.879
Mr. Fan,

23:55.079 --> 23:56.660
today's your wedding day.

23:56.680 --> 23:58.879
We should come and pay our respects.

23:59.559 --> 24:00.379
Madam,

24:00.399 --> 24:02.159
I, Wang Qinian,

24:02.399 --> 24:04.119
hereby greet you.

24:04.599 --> 24:06.740
Madam, I, Deng Ziyue,
and the rest of the First Division,

24:06.760 --> 24:08.819
are here to greet you.

24:08.839 --> 24:09.899
That's enough.

24:09.919 --> 24:12.000
We're fellow colleagues.
Spare the formalities.

24:18.680 --> 24:20.679
Why are all of you this sleepy?

24:20.800 --> 24:22.350
What did you all do last night?

24:22.760 --> 24:24.220
Mr. Fan, you may not know,

24:24.240 --> 24:25.159
but it was chaotic

24:25.159 --> 24:26.780
outside the residence last night.

24:26.800 --> 24:27.539
I told our brothers

24:27.559 --> 24:29.859
from the First Division to come

24:29.879 --> 24:31.299
and maintain order.

24:31.319 --> 24:33.420
We stayed up the entire night.

24:33.440 --> 24:34.560
How could you do so?

24:34.800 --> 24:36.780
The Imperial Inspectorate
isn't your private property.

24:36.800 --> 24:39.800
Wang, I'll deduct half a month's
worth of wage from you.

24:42.399 --> 24:44.520
And, I'll reward our brothers with it!

24:44.599 --> 24:46.599
Excellent!

24:46.599 --> 24:48.319
Mr. Fan, you mustn't do so!

24:48.320 --> 24:49.010
Thank you, Mr. Fan!

24:49.010 --> 24:50.100
- Stop cheering.
- Thank you, Mr. Wang.

24:50.100 --> 24:50.940
Stop that!

24:50.960 --> 24:53.520
Mr. Fan, our brothers
came here to maintain order

24:53.520 --> 24:55.440
of their own accord.

24:55.440 --> 24:57.619
They don't expect anything in return.

24:57.639 --> 25:00.960
Mr. Wang, we expect a reward from you!

25:00.960 --> 25:03.359
We should reward them.

25:04.399 --> 25:07.560
However, Mr. Wang shouldn't
be the one forking out the money.

25:08.040 --> 25:09.720
We should fork out the money instead.

25:11.559 --> 25:12.599
You mustn't do so!

25:12.599 --> 25:13.819
Thank you, Madam!

25:13.839 --> 25:14.930
Good job, everyone.

25:14.950 --> 25:16.560
It's our duty to reward you all.

25:19.319 --> 25:21.560
Please don't do that!
We'll skip the reward!

25:24.079 --> 25:26.139
My husband often told me

25:26.159 --> 25:27.819
that if he was alone,

25:27.839 --> 25:29.540
he could never establish
a foothold in the Capital

25:29.559 --> 25:31.370
no matter how capable he was.

25:31.390 --> 25:32.700
He's only able to get to
where he is today

25:32.720 --> 25:34.299
all thanks to you all.

25:34.319 --> 25:38.280
Here, I would like to thank you all
on my husband's behalf.

25:39.720 --> 25:41.520
Madam, please accept our bow.

25:42.319 --> 25:43.560
Mr. Wang.

25:46.839 --> 25:48.180
Madam, please don't call me that.

25:48.200 --> 25:49.639
You may call me by my name.

25:49.639 --> 25:51.119
Please call me Wang Qinian.

25:51.280 --> 25:52.539
You may even call me Little Nian

25:52.559 --> 25:54.800
if you like it.

25:55.800 --> 25:59.079
Mr. Wang, my husband
talked about you often.

25:59.079 --> 26:00.180
He said

26:00.200 --> 26:03.740
Wang Qinian knew how to adapt
to his situation accordingly.

26:03.760 --> 26:05.859
He has benefited
from your assistance greatly

26:05.879 --> 26:07.679
in the Capital.

26:09.200 --> 26:11.439
Mr. Fan is too humble.

26:12.520 --> 26:15.599
However, that's not the true reason
that touched his heart.

26:16.280 --> 26:17.480
He said

26:17.806 --> 26:19.020
he had an eccentric temper

26:19.040 --> 26:20.560
and a stubborn personality.

26:20.720 --> 26:23.560
Due to that, he didn't
have many friends in the Capital.

26:24.000 --> 26:27.200
But Wang Qinian was one of his friends.

26:31.119 --> 26:34.040
You two aren't
a master and his retainer.

26:34.119 --> 26:36.359
Or a superior and his subordinate.

26:36.520 --> 26:37.960
You two

26:39.680 --> 26:40.919
are close friends.

26:41.079 --> 26:42.720
You two are kindred spirits as well.

26:48.440 --> 26:49.599
Mr. Wang,

26:49.919 --> 26:51.240
thank you

26:51.599 --> 26:53.760
for supporting my husband all along.

26:55.520 --> 26:56.600
Madam,

26:56.879 --> 26:58.879
let me kowtow to you!

27:01.800 --> 27:02.579
What do you think?

27:02.599 --> 27:04.200
Isn't my wife eloquent?

27:04.839 --> 27:07.720
She's a level above my wife.

27:08.159 --> 27:10.940
Mr. Fan is so lucky.

27:10.960 --> 27:13.370
Mr. Fan, you're so lucky!

27:13.390 --> 27:15.190
The First Division has
plenty of affairs to attend to.

27:15.210 --> 27:16.720
You all should get back to work.

27:17.839 --> 27:20.520
Mr. Fan, you don't need to hide it anymore.

27:20.520 --> 27:22.820
We heard that you're going
to take over the Imperial Treasury.

27:22.840 --> 27:24.480
Hurry and give us our instructions.

27:24.559 --> 27:25.919
What instructions?

27:28.040 --> 27:29.500
Of course it's to seize assets.

27:29.520 --> 27:31.280
Look at all the corrupt officials
in the Capital.

27:31.280 --> 27:32.119
They're despicable.

27:32.120 --> 27:33.159
We'll seize their assets
once you give us the instructions.

27:33.159 --> 27:34.420
We have to prepare for it. I'm serious.

27:34.440 --> 27:35.639
Stop messing around!

27:35.660 --> 27:37.460
The First Division
has their own affairs to handle.

27:37.480 --> 27:39.800
I'll deal with my affairs myself.

27:45.399 --> 27:47.320
Don't act on your own initiative.

27:47.760 --> 27:50.119
No, Mr. Fan. I'm serious.

27:50.919 --> 27:52.520
Let me put them in their places.

27:52.839 --> 27:55.619
What nonsense was that? Just go already.

27:55.639 --> 27:56.339
Go back and work.

27:56.359 --> 27:57.059
Farewell.

27:57.079 --> 27:58.280
Stop messing around.

27:58.359 --> 28:00.040
All right. We'll go now.

28:00.040 --> 28:02.180
Mr. Fan, I won't
act on my own initiative, then.

28:02.200 --> 28:03.139
All right.

28:03.159 --> 28:04.780
- Let's go.
- Don't try anything stupid.

28:04.800 --> 28:06.480
All right. We won't.

28:07.480 --> 28:08.839
Wang, look.

28:11.480 --> 28:12.760
Mr. Chen gave me this wedding gift.

28:12.760 --> 28:13.720
[Hall of Joy]

28:13.720 --> 28:15.399
Hall of Joy?

28:16.000 --> 28:19.539
Isn't this the business brand
that Ye Qingmei registered back then?

28:19.559 --> 28:22.439
Back then, it amassed
all the wealth in the world.

28:22.599 --> 28:24.119
I've heard about it too.

28:24.639 --> 28:25.819
Her properties

28:25.839 --> 28:27.859
became the foundation
of the Imperial Treasury.

28:27.879 --> 28:30.020
The imperial family did
take over her properties.

28:30.040 --> 28:31.139
But back then,

28:31.159 --> 28:32.280
all the shopkeepers

28:32.280 --> 28:34.820
who started the business brand
with Ye Qingmei,

28:34.840 --> 28:36.139
they're still in the Capital.

28:36.159 --> 28:39.119
They're handling Hall of Joy right now.

28:39.200 --> 28:41.059
Is Hall of Joy a shop?

28:41.079 --> 28:42.619
They don't

28:42.639 --> 28:44.000
open shops themselves.

28:44.159 --> 28:46.619
They charge rent
from the people who rent the shops.

28:46.639 --> 28:47.819
They're essentially

28:47.839 --> 28:49.280
shopkeepers.

28:49.599 --> 28:51.420
They're professional managers, huh?

28:51.440 --> 28:53.020
Not bad at all.

28:53.040 --> 28:54.180
Come again?

28:54.200 --> 28:55.280
It's nothing.

28:57.079 --> 29:00.119
But after Ye Qingmei's death,

29:00.159 --> 29:01.800
is there still a feud

29:01.839 --> 29:03.299
between the Imperial Treasury

29:03.319 --> 29:05.000
and the shopkeepers?

29:05.559 --> 29:07.379
That's the riddle Mr. Chen gave me.

29:07.399 --> 29:09.040
I have to go and take a look.

29:09.500 --> 29:14.545
[Hall of Joy]

29:23.359 --> 29:25.639
You're here to greet us yourself, huh?

29:26.280 --> 29:29.599
This is the head shopkeeper
of Hall of Joy.

29:29.960 --> 29:32.859
This is the inspector
of the Imperial Inspectorate,

29:32.879 --> 29:34.599
Mr. Fan Xian.

29:35.159 --> 29:36.960
Please come in.

29:47.159 --> 29:48.599
Sirs, please follow me.

29:56.399 --> 29:58.119
Mr. Fan.

30:00.480 --> 30:02.760
Mr. Fan.

30:03.559 --> 30:05.520
Mr. Fan.

30:07.680 --> 30:08.359
Mr. Fan.

30:08.359 --> 30:09.500
Mr. Fan, these are

30:09.520 --> 30:11.960
the shopkeepers of Hall of Joy.

30:12.559 --> 30:14.399
They're happy to see you.

30:14.839 --> 30:17.480
What are they happy about?

30:18.839 --> 30:19.960
Over here, please.

30:28.800 --> 30:30.000
Is this

30:30.200 --> 30:32.240
a funeral?

30:40.879 --> 30:42.599
What do you mean?

31:00.119 --> 31:01.200
Mr. Fan,

31:01.639 --> 31:03.480
something feels off.

31:13.975 --> 31:16.520
[Memorial Tablet of Ye Qingmei]

31:21.460 --> 31:23.419
Ye Qingmei?

31:44.079 --> 31:45.320
Young Lady,

31:47.000 --> 31:48.879
Young Master has returned.

31:49.079 --> 31:53.399
Young Lady, Young Master has returned.

31:53.639 --> 32:03.850
Young Master has returned.

32:03.850 --> 32:05.510
[Head Shopkeeper of Hall of Joy]
Young Master has returned.

32:05.510 --> 32:09.740
Young Lady, Young Master has returned!

32:09.760 --> 32:11.320
Enough already.

32:11.399 --> 32:14.139
I'll chat with Young Master.

32:14.159 --> 32:15.780
You all should stop

32:15.800 --> 32:17.679
startling him.

32:18.440 --> 32:20.879
If so, we'll leave for now.

32:21.159 --> 32:22.639
Farewell.

32:28.319 --> 32:30.460
Sir, you should have a seat as well.

32:30.480 --> 32:31.879
That's right. Please.

32:33.200 --> 32:35.119
As she's our mistress,

32:35.359 --> 32:36.619
you're the young master.

32:36.639 --> 32:37.700
When you're around,

32:37.720 --> 32:39.760
I have no reason to sit.

32:43.559 --> 32:45.240
Ye Qingmei is my mother.

32:46.599 --> 32:47.879
Ye Qingmei

32:48.399 --> 32:50.359
is your mother?

32:51.879 --> 32:54.439
Is he trustworthy?

32:56.520 --> 32:58.599
Well, sir,

32:58.879 --> 33:01.299
we've known each other for many years.

33:01.319 --> 33:01.879
I've always been...

33:01.879 --> 33:03.180
I only trust

33:03.200 --> 33:04.599
Young Master.

33:08.520 --> 33:09.600
He's trustworthy.

33:12.599 --> 33:13.800
Young Master,

33:14.365 --> 33:16.130
actually, we knew you were here

33:16.150 --> 33:17.919
when you first arrived at the Capital.

33:18.000 --> 33:19.859
We even sneaked a peak at you

33:19.879 --> 33:21.099
on the streets.

33:21.119 --> 33:24.119
So you knew that
I was her son long ago?

33:25.440 --> 33:27.280
Young Lady told us herself.

33:29.639 --> 33:31.500
How? Did she tell you in a dream?

33:31.520 --> 33:35.000
Young Lady told me about it
when she was still alive.

33:35.319 --> 33:36.800
She was also the one

33:37.000 --> 33:38.480
who named you.

33:38.680 --> 33:40.020
She named me?

33:40.040 --> 33:41.200
Fan Xian?

33:41.240 --> 33:42.320
That's right.

33:42.760 --> 33:44.159
That doesn't make sense.

33:44.359 --> 33:45.119
I haven't been born yet.

33:45.119 --> 33:46.740
How would she know
that my surname was Fan?

33:46.760 --> 33:48.020
Mr. Fan,

33:48.040 --> 33:49.460
your father's surname is Fan

33:49.480 --> 33:50.760
no matter if you're born or not.

33:50.760 --> 33:52.960
Of course your surname is Fan.

33:53.879 --> 33:56.720
Young Lady once said
that she might not live for long

33:56.720 --> 33:59.539
before her passing.

33:59.559 --> 34:01.460
If she survived,

34:01.480 --> 34:03.119
it'd be hard to say

34:03.560 --> 34:04.780
what your surname would be.

34:04.800 --> 34:06.660
But if she passed away,

34:06.680 --> 34:09.600
your name would definitely be Fan Xian.

34:11.399 --> 34:13.560
If she passed away,

34:13.560 --> 34:16.359
my name would definitely be Fan Xian?

34:16.839 --> 34:19.640
I still don't get it.

34:19.919 --> 34:21.240
How did she pass away?

34:21.319 --> 34:23.999
After Young Lady
passed the message to me,

34:24.240 --> 34:25.299
she gave the business brand

34:25.319 --> 34:27.700
to the imperial family
not long after that.

34:27.720 --> 34:30.080
After that, I never saw her again.

34:30.919 --> 34:33.120
As for how she passed away,

34:33.919 --> 34:35.479
I'm not too sure either.

34:41.440 --> 34:42.730
I've been in the Capital
for a long time.

34:42.750 --> 34:44.459
Have you not thought of
meeting me in person before?

34:44.479 --> 34:46.359
Young Master, you might not know,

34:47.039 --> 34:48.700
but we're

34:48.720 --> 34:50.320
under surveillance.

34:50.359 --> 34:52.600
His Majesty issued an edict.

34:52.959 --> 34:54.640
The old retainers of the Ye family

34:54.680 --> 34:56.919
are not to leave the Capital.

34:58.439 --> 35:00.959
The imperial family fears us.

35:01.240 --> 35:02.600
Do they fear you all?

35:02.919 --> 35:04.140
They fear Young Lady.

35:04.160 --> 35:05.959
Although Young Lady had passed away

35:05.959 --> 35:07.060
for many years,

35:07.080 --> 35:08.559
they still

35:08.720 --> 35:10.019
fear us.

35:10.039 --> 35:11.080
Even people like us

35:11.080 --> 35:13.106
who worked under her in the past

35:13.126 --> 35:14.979
were kept under surveillance as well.

35:14.999 --> 35:16.879
We dared not look for you.

35:16.959 --> 35:18.280
We were afraid

35:18.400 --> 35:19.939
that we would cause you trouble.

35:19.959 --> 35:21.120
However,

35:21.519 --> 35:24.720
we knew everything that happened to you

35:24.766 --> 35:26.525
after you came to the Capital.

35:27.959 --> 35:30.559
So, have you been
working for her back then?

35:30.959 --> 35:32.060
Young Lady trusted me.

35:32.080 --> 35:33.559
She made me the manager

35:33.800 --> 35:35.240
of our branch in the Capital.

35:43.600 --> 35:45.399
What kind of person was she?

35:47.999 --> 35:49.519
In the current world,

35:51.600 --> 35:55.160
there's no one as dazzling as her.

35:56.600 --> 35:58.240
[Ye Qingmei]
She was

36:00.439 --> 36:01.559
perfect.

36:03.680 --> 36:05.479
Besides managing businesses,

36:06.120 --> 36:08.600
she knew everything there is
to be known in the world.

36:09.439 --> 36:12.439
She knew why the sea
had ebbs and flows.

36:12.479 --> 36:16.080
She knew why the moon had
different phases.

36:16.959 --> 36:18.760
Young Lady could also compose poems.

36:21.359 --> 36:23.499
Young Master, your poem,

36:23.519 --> 36:26.740
"A thousand miles from home,
I'm grieved at autumn's plight"

36:26.760 --> 36:28.580
that was a great poem.

36:28.600 --> 36:31.280
However, Young Lady's poems

36:31.839 --> 36:33.180
were different from usual poems.

36:33.200 --> 36:34.339
To be honest,

36:34.359 --> 36:37.200
she even composed a poem for me before.

36:37.560 --> 36:38.760
Recite it for me.

36:41.519 --> 36:42.919
Staring eyes

36:44.240 --> 36:46.559
like copper bells.

36:47.439 --> 36:51.359
A lightning-fast mind.

36:53.560 --> 36:56.780
Ears that perk up like antennae.

36:56.800 --> 37:01.200
Alert to all suspicious sounds?

37:04.280 --> 37:05.919
Young Master,

37:06.120 --> 37:08.160
do you have any questions?

37:09.240 --> 37:10.540
Young Lady explained the term

37:10.560 --> 37:13.519
"antennae" to me before.

37:14.800 --> 37:18.800
The thunder from the Ninth Heaven
descends to the mortal world,

37:18.959 --> 37:20.540
with a silver streak hanging vertically,

37:20.560 --> 37:23.019
resembling a line
suspended from the sky.

37:23.039 --> 37:25.420
It signifies keen senses

37:25.440 --> 37:27.300
and the ability to perceive everything.

37:29.519 --> 37:31.559
Was that her explanation?

37:34.280 --> 37:37.080
When the business brand
was first established,

37:37.240 --> 37:39.379
Young Lady and I traveled the world.

37:39.399 --> 37:41.220
We once captured several thieves.

37:41.240 --> 37:42.999
Due to that,

37:43.439 --> 37:45.039
she composed that poem for me.

37:45.999 --> 37:47.800
That was the best gift

37:48.080 --> 37:50.280
I've ever received in my life.

37:50.720 --> 37:51.919
That poem

37:51.999 --> 37:54.559
is unique indeed.

37:58.959 --> 38:00.080
I guess I know

38:00.080 --> 38:02.080
the type of person she was now.

38:04.800 --> 38:05.880
Sir,

38:06.439 --> 38:07.900
there are more than lyrics to the poem.

38:07.920 --> 38:08.960
There's also a song as well.

38:08.980 --> 38:10.419
I'll teach you about it in the future.

38:10.439 --> 38:11.519
All right.

38:12.999 --> 38:15.060
We were prepared for the loss incurred

38:15.080 --> 38:16.879
by the Imperial Treasury long ago.

38:18.479 --> 38:20.180
Do you all have that much money?

38:20.200 --> 38:21.560
We don't have any money.

38:21.580 --> 38:23.500
But the shops in the Capital
do possess that kind of money.

38:23.519 --> 38:24.859
Which shop?

38:24.879 --> 38:27.499
None of the shops has that much money.

38:27.519 --> 38:31.680
However, if you include
all of the shops in the Capital,

38:31.999 --> 38:34.060
we'll be able to fill this hole.

38:34.080 --> 38:35.600
All of the shops?

38:38.120 --> 38:39.419
All of us

38:39.439 --> 38:41.740
are shopkeepers
of the shops in the Capital.

38:41.760 --> 38:43.600
We were diligent,
and we were never greedy.

38:43.600 --> 38:44.820
We finally made a name for ourselves

38:44.839 --> 38:47.039
after all these years.

38:47.600 --> 38:50.419
Right now, any shops
that are famous in the Capital

38:50.439 --> 38:51.859
all employ

38:51.879 --> 38:53.980
the shopkeepers of Hall of Joy.

38:54.000 --> 38:55.359
Let me put it this way.

38:55.680 --> 38:58.226
If those shops have

38:58.246 --> 39:00.405
any dirty secrets,

39:01.319 --> 39:02.979
we know them better

39:02.999 --> 39:04.439
than the shop owners.

39:06.200 --> 39:09.519
So you people have the goods on them?

39:10.240 --> 39:11.359
Young Master,

39:11.800 --> 39:13.459
just give us ten days.

39:13.479 --> 39:14.700
We'll work together

39:14.720 --> 39:15.979
and accumulate the money

39:15.999 --> 39:17.580
bit by bit.

39:17.600 --> 39:19.019
I'll make sure

39:19.039 --> 39:20.740
they gather you 20 million taels

39:20.760 --> 39:23.120
as your wedding gift.

39:25.439 --> 39:26.519
Mr. Fan,

39:26.800 --> 39:28.359
this idea might work.

39:36.359 --> 39:37.700
Young Master, don't worry.

39:37.720 --> 39:39.060
Just leave the debt collection to us.

39:39.080 --> 39:40.600
Your reputation won't be affected.

39:40.620 --> 39:42.319
You're coercing the shop owners
to pay you by force?

39:42.319 --> 39:43.620
How will you all clean up the mess?

39:43.640 --> 39:46.499
It doesn't matter.
At most, we'll resign from our posts.

39:46.519 --> 39:48.600
Merchants prioritize profit above all.

39:48.800 --> 39:49.630
If you don't handle it well,

39:49.640 --> 39:50.800
they'll employ hitmen.

39:50.800 --> 39:52.319
By then, all of you will be in danger.

39:52.319 --> 39:53.472
That's fine.

39:53.492 --> 39:55.773
We've already lived long enough.

39:55.839 --> 39:57.760
- We're already content...
- No way.

39:58.200 --> 40:00.740
Do you think my mother would do the same
if she were in my shoes?

40:00.879 --> 40:02.600
Your eyes were gleaming

40:02.600 --> 40:03.660
when you talked about her.

40:03.680 --> 40:04.600
You sounded so proud.

40:04.600 --> 40:05.860
If she were in my shoes,

40:05.880 --> 40:06.979
I don't think she would do this.

40:06.999 --> 40:09.359
But Young Master,
we're in a dire situation.

40:09.359 --> 40:10.399
Had my mother not encountered

40:10.399 --> 40:12.039
any dire situations back then?

40:12.080 --> 40:13.640
Had she ever compromised before?

40:13.660 --> 40:15.720
Regarding the loss
that the Imperial Treasury had incurred,

40:15.720 --> 40:17.080
I'll handle it myself.

40:17.680 --> 40:20.580
Young Master,
it's over 20 million taels.

40:20.600 --> 40:22.940
You can't resolve the issue by yourself.

40:22.960 --> 40:24.379
No matter how difficult it is,

40:24.399 --> 40:25.800
I have to give it a try.

40:25.839 --> 40:28.760
As her son, I can't afford
to bring shame to her name.

40:33.879 --> 40:36.439
But I do need your help with something.

40:37.680 --> 40:39.399
Write down the names
of all the shop owners

40:39.399 --> 40:40.859
in the Capital.

40:40.879 --> 40:42.220
Make a name list for me.

40:42.240 --> 40:43.320
Yes, Mr. Fan.

40:45.039 --> 40:46.119
Everyone,

40:46.479 --> 40:47.780
I appreciate

40:47.800 --> 40:49.160
your kind thought.

40:49.399 --> 40:51.912
Young Master, you're too courteous.

40:51.932 --> 40:53.892
Sir, I'll see my way out.

40:56.160 --> 40:57.240
Mr. Fan,

40:57.359 --> 40:59.939
I think Head Shopkeeper's idea

40:59.959 --> 41:01.738
is viable.

41:01.758 --> 41:03.718
If the merchants do try to kill them,

41:03.720 --> 41:06.640
we can instruct our peers
from the First Division to protect them.

41:07.039 --> 41:09.160
If you push someone to the abyss

41:09.359 --> 41:10.919
before pulling them up,

41:11.000 --> 41:12.920
the nature of the situation will change.

41:25.319 --> 41:28.280
Young Master is truly a kind child.

41:30.560 --> 41:32.320
Initially, I thought

41:33.240 --> 41:35.080
the light had been extinguished

41:35.600 --> 41:37.399
after Young Lady's death.

41:40.680 --> 41:42.120
It turned out

41:43.359 --> 41:45.760
that light can be inherited.

42:12.080 --> 42:13.660
Why are you still standing there?

42:13.680 --> 42:15.780
Make yourself at home. Have a seat.

42:15.800 --> 42:16.880
Aunt,

42:17.640 --> 42:18.780
this is my home.

42:18.800 --> 42:21.600
Why are you being courteous, then?
Sit anywhere you like.

42:40.359 --> 42:41.919
What are you doing right now?

42:42.087 --> 42:43.979
I have nothing to do anyway.

42:43.999 --> 42:46.538
I'm mixing a new rouge color.

42:46.558 --> 42:47.877
Didn't you bring all these flowers here

42:47.879 --> 42:49.299
to deliver them to Fan Xian?

42:49.319 --> 42:50.640
He didn't want them.

42:52.160 --> 42:53.519
Why don't you take them?

42:54.280 --> 42:55.499
I dare not take them.

42:55.519 --> 42:57.120
I'm here to thank you.

42:57.519 --> 42:59.120
For what?

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
